    "hero": {
      "title": "🧚‍♀️ Fairy Town Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Generate enchanting fairy town names perfect for fantasy worldbuilding, D&D campaigns, and folklore-inspired settings."
    },
    "intro": "Fairy town names capture the magic and mystery of the Fae realm. From 'Moonwhisper' to 'Silvermist', these names evoke enchanted glades, mystical forests, and otherworldly settlements where fairies dance under moonlit skies. Our **Fairy Town Name Generator** creates authentic fairy place names that blend Celtic, Nordic, and naturalistic folklore traditions, perfect for creating magical settlements in your fantasy world.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "The Magic of Fairy Town Names",
        "content": "<p>Fairy town names serve multiple purposes in fantasy worldbuilding: they identify magical settlements, create memorable locations, establish a connection to nature and the Fae realm, and add depth to fantasy settings. A well-chosen fairy town name can instantly convey whether a settlement is a woodland haven (Moonwhisper), a star-touched sanctuary (Starhaven), or an elemental stronghold (Silvermist).</p><p>These names draw from authentic fairy and Fae naming conventions found in Celtic, Nordic, and naturalistic folklore traditions, emphasizing connections to nature, elements, and magical realms.</p>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "How to Use Fairy Town Names",
        "content": "<p>Fairy town names work excellently for:</p><ul><li><strong>D&D Campaigns:</strong> Create memorable fairy settlements for your players to discover</li><li><strong>Fantasy Writing:</strong> Name magical towns and villages in your stories</li><li><strong>Worldbuilding:</strong> Establish naming traditions for Fae realms in your fantasy world</li><li><strong>Map Creation:</strong> Add enchanting place names to your fantasy maps</li></ul><p>Simply generate names and choose the ones that best fit your world's magical atmosphere.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "What makes a good fairy town name?",
        "answer": "Good fairy town names typically reference nature, elements, magical phenomena, or Fae traditions. They often use lyrical sounds, compound words, and descriptive elements that evoke enchantment and otherworldly beauty."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can I use these names for other fantasy settings?",
        "answer": "Absolutely! While designed for fairy and Fae settings, these names work well for any magical or nature-based fantasy world. They're versatile and can fit various fantasy genres."
